OL,3,GNEWSAStop and search powers following
OL,4,Afatal stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice will be using stop and search
OL,7,Fpowers in an area of Birmingham
OL,8,Ffollowing a fatal stabbing.
OL,10,FA man in his 30s died in hospital on
OL,11,FFriday after being found with stab
OL,12,Fwounds in the Hodge Hill area of the
OL,13,Fcity on Tuesday.
OL,15,FWest Midlands Police said a murder
OL,16,Finvestigation was underway and it has
OL,17,Fappealed for witnesses and further
OL,18,Finformation.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
