OL,3,GNEWSAStop and search powers following
OL,4,Afatal stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Neighbourhood Chief
OL,7,FInspector Chanelle Whitney said:
OL,8,F"Residents will continue to see extra
OL,9,Fofficers in the area, and we again urge
OL,10,Fanyone with concerns to speak to us."
